sed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-05T15:42:09Z","updated_at":"2026-02-06T14:23:26Z","closed_at":"2026-02-06T14:23:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.6.0, 4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.2.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M4 (Apple9) - Apple M4 (10 threads) - 16.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe AnimationTree editor crashes the godot editor when I try to rename a tree node.\n\nI found that this issue only occurs when the tree has exactly 11 nodes. If you add or remove one node, the issue does not occur.\n\nAdditionally, if you create any nodes in the editor after the first launch, the issue does not occur. You must attempt to rename a node first when opening the mixed tree to reproduce this issue.\n\nIn the Video:\n\n1. Open the editor (with 11 nodes), rename a node => Crash\n2. Open the editor (with 11 nodes), add a node, delete it, then rename a node => Safe\n3. Open the editor (with 12 nodes), rename a node => Safe\n4. Open the editor (with 10 nodes), rename a node => Safe\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78c03d31-9b39-456c-8098-655161022159\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Clone this project https://github.com/InfiniteXyy/godot-animation-tree-crash-minimum-reproduce, or download the MBP zip\n2. Open `node_3d.tscn`, try to rename any node inside the animation blend tree\n3. The editor will crash\n<img width=\"1998\" height=\"1556\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f80f8fc-18a6-4862-ab09-d0f8059eddb5\" />\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[new-game-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25100116/new-game-project.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115912/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115912/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}